message: "If you use or implement TSTO/00 or JEP-TSTO Binding/00, please cite this publication."
title: "TSTO/00: Target State Transition Object Specification and JEP-TSTO Binding/00"
type: generic
authors:
  - family-names: "Wang"
    given-names: "Yuqiang"
    affiliation: "Cognitive Emergence"
version: "00"
date-released: 2026-08-03
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  TSTO/00 defines an immutable, addressable, and verifiable target state
  transition object expressing what change counts as completion. The companion
  JEP-TSTO Binding/00 defines how JEP-Core 0.6 event claims bind to that object
  while responsibility, execution, settlement, and legal effect remain external.
keywords:
  - Target State Transition Object
  - verifiable result
  - state transition
  - outcome specification
  - verification policy
  - JEP
  - agent interoperability

